  m_text: "BREACH PROTOCOL is a futuristic survival roguelite where you play as a
    hacker fighting through an increasingly hostile corporate system while stealing
    experimental technology and valuable Data.\r\n\r\nThe longer you survive, the
    more Data you collect \u2014 and the greater the threat becomes.\r\n\r\nRUN DATA\r\nData
    collected during a breach can be spent on temporary upgrades that increase your
    power for the current run.\r\n\r\nARCHIVED DATA\r\nPersistent Data survives between
    runs and can be used to unlock permanent progression including new weapons, starting
    loadouts, killstreak programs, and more.\r\n\r\nEvery run makes you stronger.\r\nEvery
    wave pushes you further."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
